flowchart LR
    D[Discover and define] --> B[Baseline]
    B --> C[Configure controls]
    C --> R[Run bounded cohort]
    R --> M[Measure outcomes and guardrails]
    M --> G{Evidence gate}
    G -->|proven| E[Expand]
    G -->|unclear| A[Adjust / re-baseline]
    G -->|not acceptable| S[Stop safely]
    A --> R
